{
  "source": "Prompts/whats-an-llm-v1.mp4",
  "duration": 145.28,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.14,
      "text": "How does an AI model learn that Jelly fits after peanut butter end before a user ever prompts it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.6,
      "end": 7.7,
      "text": "It learns from examples."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.4,
      "end": 13.02,
      "text": "To understand how, we have to separate the user interface from the technology underneath."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.92,
      "end": 15.28,
      "text": "ChatGPT is the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.86,
      "end": 17.0,
      "text": "The LLM is the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.9,
      "end": 21.54,
      "text": "Under the hood, a large language model, or LLM, does the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.28,
      "end": 24.64,
      "text": "The large part of that engine refers to scale."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.3,
      "end": 29.64,
      "text": "These models are trained by processing massive amounts of text and computer code,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.64,
      "end": 35.56,
      "text": "language describes the model's core functions, reading, writing, summarizing, translating,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.92,
      "end": 36.8,
      "text": "and explaining information."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.72,
      "end": 42.3,
      "text": "Finally, a model uses learned numerical patterns to predict a likely output."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.74,
      "end": 46.22,
      "text": "After peanut butter and Jelly is a familiar continuation."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.06,
      "end": 49.34,
      "text": "Twinkle, twinkle, little, star."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.18,
      "end": 51.66,
      "text": "Once upon a, time."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.46,
      "end": 54.12,
      "text": "Better late then, never."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.24,
      "end": 57.22,
      "text": "Simple phrases like these make the concept visible,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.22,
      "end": 60.46,
      "text": "but the learning reaches much further into complex structures."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.26,
      "end": 65.4,
      "text": "The model identifies patterns and how people explain ideas, solve logical problems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.92,
      "end": 67.22,
      "text": "and even how they misspell words."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.2,
      "end": 70.68,
      "text": "Training has built patterns into the model's internal numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.3,
      "end": 74.14,
      "text": "Now let's see how the model uses those patterns to build an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.04,
      "end": 79.3,
      "text": "This diagram shows a process similar to the predictive text keyboard on your phone."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 83.08,
      "text": "It suggests a word, you tap it, and it suggests the next."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.08,
      "end": 88.82,
      "text": "But a language model continuously loops this action automatically to build a complete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.48,
      "end": 94.18,
      "text": "Looking at the first panel, we start the loop with I want to buy peanut butter and"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.18,
      "end": 97.94,
      "text": "the model calculates the probabilities and adds the word Jelly."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.48,
      "end": 103.1,
      "text": "In the second step, the text now says I want to buy peanut butter and Jelly."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.88,
      "end": 108.88,
      "text": "The model uses that entire updated string to calculate the next step, adding the word for."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.88,
      "end": 113.84,
      "text": "Moving to the third panel, the context expands to and Jelly 4."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.48,
      "end": 117.2,
      "text": "Based on this new input, the model adds lunch."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.06,
      "end": 123.8,
      "text": "The foundational rule is that each chosen word immediately becomes part of the input for the very next prediction."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.66,
      "end": 131.64,
      "text": "To generate a full paragraph, the model runs this exact loop of predicting, adding, and updating many times over."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.1,
      "end": 134.9,
      "text": "It happens at speeds fast enough to look like active thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.42,
      "end": 136.98,
      "text": "Training builds the patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.98,
      "end": 141.88,
      "text": "The model uses those patterns to build your answer, one word at a time."
    }
  ],
